      title: "Oxbow Estates HOA et al v. Metropolitan Development Commission (Willows \"The Elements\" Rezoning Settlement)",
      brief: "Neighbors' rezoning challenge to J.C. Hart Co.'s $61 million Willows site redevelopment in Indianapolis settled once the project was cut to 168 apartments with no townhomes; the council approved it 24-0.",
      category: "zoning-land-use",
      status: "settled",
