        "The Anchorage Community Development Authority filed a complaint on July 21, 2026 in state Superior Court against Hughes Family LLC and Anchorage Innovation District LLC, seeking a court-ordered sale of the former Nordstrom building at Sixth Avenue and D Street, the Anchorage Daily News reported on August 12. The three-story building has been vacant since 2019, when Nordstrom closed after 44 years there.",
