      summary: "The Greater DC Diaper Bank is seeking more than $775,000 plus interest from WWDC Industrial Park, LLC and property manager Donohoe Real Estate Services, Inc., alleging they failed for years to fix a leaking roof at its warehouse on Monard Drive in Silver Spring, Maryland, WJLA/7News reported. The suit, first filed in D.C. Superior Court, was removed to federal court in Washington on August 17, 2026 and transferred to the District of Maryland in September. WWDC has counterclaimed against the Diaper Bank, and both defendants filed motions to dismiss before the transfer.",
