      brief: "Walker & Dunlop, for Freddie Mac, accuses Lakewood, N.J., investor Chaim Bialostozky of using back-to-back sales to obtain oversized loans; Fannie Mae has filed its own Chicago foreclosures. About $44 million is in foreclosure.",
      category: "lending-foreclosure",
