      property: {"name": "Rochester Tech Park", "city": "Rochester", "state": "NY"},
      addedDate: "2026-11-03",
      title: "Wells Fargo Bank, N.A. v. Tech Park Owner LLC (Rochester Tech Park $96.9M Foreclosure)",
      brief: "Wells Fargo seeks summary judgment in its foreclosure on Rochester Tech Park, a 288-acre office and industrial complex in Gates, alleging the owner and guarantors owe $96.9 million in principal.",
