      sourceUrl: "https://rbj.net/2026/10/22/wells-fargo-summary-judgment-rochester-tech-park-foreclosure/",
      summary: "Wells Fargo Bank, N.A., which provided just over $110 million in loans on Rochester Tech Park in 2017, has asked a Monroe County court for summary judgment in its 18-month-old foreclosure against Tech Park Owner LLC, the Rochester Business Journal reported on October 22, 2026. The lender alleges the owner and two guarantors defaulted and owe $96.9 million in principal plus interest, and it also details $2.356 million it paid Rochester Gas & Electric in 2024 to restore and keep power at the property. Justice Daniel J. Doyle is scheduled to hear arguments on January 12, 2027.",
